## 1. `Extensions/ArmClientBuilderExtensions.cs`
The method `AddArmClient<TBuilder, TConfiguration>` at line 27-31 calls `RegisterClientFactory` which is marked `[RequiresUnreferencedCode]` and `[RequiresDynamicCode]`. Add these attributes to the method:

