```

## 2. `GenericOperationSource.cs`
This is `internal class GenericOperationSource<T> : IOperationSource<T>`. Lines 37 and 40 have IL2087 warnings because `typeof(T)` is passed to methods requiring `DynamicallyAccessedMembers`.

Line 37: `ModelReaderWriter.Read(response.Content, typeof(T))` needs `PublicConstructors | NonPublicConstructors`
Line 40: `Activator.CreateInstance(typeof(T), BindingFlags.NonPublic | BindingFlags.Instance, ...)` needs `NonPublicConstructors`

Add `[DynamicallyAccessedMembers]` to the generic type parameter T on the class:
```csharp
internal class GenericOperationSource<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.PublicConstructors | DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.NonPublicConstructors)] T> : IOperationSource<T>
```

Make sure `using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;` is present (it already is at line 8).

## 3. `ArmOperation.cs`
The method `IsResource<T>()` at lines 96-111 has IL2090 and IL2087 warnings because `typeof(T)` is used with `GetConstructor` (needs `NonPublicConstructors`) and `Activator.CreateInstance` (needs `NonPublicConstructors`).

Add `[DynamicallyAccessedMembers]` to the generic type parameter T in `IsResource<T>()`:
```csharp
private static bool IsResource<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.NonPublicConstructors)] T>() where T : notnull
```

Add `using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;` at the top of the file (among the other using statements).

## 4. `ArmEnvironment.cs`
Line 80: `JsonSerializer.Serialize(this)` in `ToString()` - replace with manual JSON serialization. The struct has properties: `Endpoint` (Uri), `Audience` (string), `DefaultScope` (string).

Replace the `ToString()` method:
```csharp
public override string ToString()
{
    using var stream = new System.IO.MemoryStream();
    using (var writer = new Utf8JsonWriter(stream))
    {
        writer.WriteStartObject();
        writer.WriteString("Endpoint", Endpoint?.ToString());
        writer.WriteString("Audience", Audience);
        writer.WriteString("DefaultScope", DefaultScope);
        writer.WriteEndObject();
    }
    return System.Text.Encoding.UTF8.GetString(stream.ToArray());
}
```

## 5. `ArmClientOptions.cs`
Line 52: `JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Dictionary<string, Dictionary<string, JsonElement>>>(span)` - replace with `JsonDocument` parsing.

Current code (lines 51-52):
```csharp
var span = BinaryData.FromStream(stream).ToMemory().Span;
var allProfile = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Dictionary<string, Dictionary<string, JsonElement>>>(span);
```

Replace with:
```csharp
var bytes = BinaryData.FromStream(stream).ToMemory();
using var profileDoc = JsonDocument.Parse(bytes);
var allProfile = new Dictionary<string, Dictionary<string, JsonElement>>();
foreach (var section in profileDoc.RootElement.EnumerateObject())
